Then for all $N\in\Z_+$ there is $C_N$  such that, with $u=e^{tQ}u_0$ and
$\epsilon=\sqrt{\gamma h/2}$, for all $1\le p\le\infty$, and all $\epsilon,\gamma\in(0,1]$,
